    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d442">

                <pb facs="0767" n="1725" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1725"/>

                <head>No. 1.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Marquis of Salisbury to Mr.
                        Herbert.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegraphic]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Foreign Office</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-11-05"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 5,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>You may, if the United States Government have not yet been informed, write to
                    Secretary of State that, by instructions from Her Majesty’s Government, you
                    have, in the absence of Lord Sackville, been placed in charge of the
                    legation.</p>
            </div>
